  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialPopup
  popupPanel: {fileID: 0}
  popupText: {fileID: 0}
  steps:
  - "Welcome, agent. Something nasty is loose in Grandma\u2019s computer, and you\u2019re our best shot."
  - <b>Mouse</b> = look around. Stay sharp. (Yes, the cats are watching.)
  - <b>Arrow keys</b> or <b>WASD</b> = move. Try not to knock anything off the desktop.
  - The doors respresent applications - these are your toolkit. New level, new tools.
  - "The File app holds intel on your target. Read it. Use it. Don\u2019t delete Grandma\u2019s recipes."
  - <b>E</b> = open doors. Some are locked and need a key, so keep an eye out for shiny things.
  tutorialId: 
  playOnStart: 1
  onlyOnce: 1
  onComplete:
    m_PersistentCalls:
